      "notes": [
        "Loft and swing weight are from my file. Lie, length, bounce and offset (marked †) are from Ping’s published spec charts for each head, added 14 Nov 2026.",
        "My file gives color code Black and “std” length. Ping’s charts say their lie angles are for Black color code at standard length, so the chart lie and length are used as they stand.",
        "Bounce: Ping says bounce varies slightly with non-standard lofts. My clubs are at Retro Spec lofts, so real bounce will differ a little from the chart. Nothing has been adjusted.",
        "My lofts match Ping’s i59 Retro Spec lofts for every club, including the two i230s. Ping’s own i230 chart lists 28.0° and 31.5° as Retro Spec for the 5 and 6.",
        "Swing weight E4 is from my file, and I confirmed it on 14 Nov 2026. Ping’s charts list D1 to D2 as standard.",
        "Head material and finish are from Ping’s own product pages for each head. Right-handed is from me, not my file. My file has no grip or shaft material.",
        "Serial numbers are in my file but left off this public page."
      ],
